    <meta name="description" content="The BELFEM project's Scientific Core Libraries repository offers open-source numerical libraries optimized for Intel Core and Intel Xeon architectures on Enterprise Linux systems.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="scientific libraries, open-source numerical libraries, high-performance computing, Intel Core, Intel Xeon, Enterprise Linux, Rocky Linux, Alma Linux, Amazon Linux, numerical computations, MPI, CUDA support">
